{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15210200","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1521020001:1":{"text":"驚いたよ……まさかこんな時に、君たちみたいな親切な人に出会えるなんて……！","source_cn":"真……真没想到，这么艰难的时候还能遇到好心人……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD54B76FD05A6903","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521020002:0":{"text":"本当に……飢饉と干ばつで、家の物は全部食べ物と交換しちゃったから、こんなに丈夫で暖かい服を着たのはいつぶりかしら……","source_cn":"是啊……自从饥荒和干旱开始，我家的东西就全都拿去换食物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3CA19A9A9106D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521020003:0":{"text":"これは普通の服ではないのか？倉庫から適当に持ってきただけなのだが……","source_cn":"这衣服不是很普通吗？我只是从库房里随便拿了几件。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F8A0A835AD24E68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521020004:0":{"text":"他にも必要としている人がいるのなら、全員に配って――","source_cn":"如果有很多人都需要的话，我应该可以给每个人都——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x670779E7D09923CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521020005:0":{"text":"……ごほんっ。","source_cn":"……咳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34B517AEBE0D72A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521020006:0":{"text":"ん、どうした？そなたも風邪を引いたか？","source_cn":"你干嘛咳嗽？也感冒了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885EA8181A02BA1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521020007:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……<key:dialog100>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95CDD3EF7C0AB622","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521020008:0":{"text":"ありがとう。本当に優しい子たちね。","source_cn":"好孩子们，谢谢你们的好意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1519BF910F3CA739","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521020009:0":{"text":"実は……私と夫のヴァロは、もうホーリン城を出ようと思ってるの。","source_cn":"其实……我和我丈夫瓦罗已经在考虑要不要离开呼临城了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F83153F5D479DF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521020010:0":{"text":"ホーリン城を出る？どうしてだ！？","source_cn":"离开呼临城？为什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB27F46B64A232E35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521020011:1":{"text":"目の前の光景を見て分からないのか？","source_cn":"这还用问吗？原因都摆在眼前了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9315246E64D3B60C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521020012:1":{"text":"干ばつに飢饉、戦争、そして今度は洪水ときた……家も売っちまったし、俺たちには住む場所さえないんだ。","source_cn":"先是干旱、饥荒，又是战争、洪水……我们的房子早就变卖了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC50CB7ED93DC0620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521020013:0":{"text":"これでも幸運な方さ。少なくとも、流される前に家を売って食料を手に入れることができたんだからな。","source_cn":"这还算是幸运的。至少在房子被冲塌之前，我们换来了一点口粮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x541CAACF24371A85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521020014:0":{"text":"それに家族も……子どもたちはずいぶん前に軍に召集されたきり、何の知らせもないの。","source_cn":"还有我们的亲人……我们的孩子很早就被征召入伍。从那以后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF554AD20FCF418AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521020015:0":{"text":"もしかしたら、もう……","source_cn":"也许他早已经不在人世了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D5D6AAE4A61445C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521020016:0":{"text":"ここに残っても、悲しみが増すだけだ。もっと早くに離れるべきだったんだよ。","source_cn":"呼临城是个伤心地，我们早就该离开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7E572D010DEDC48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521020017:0":{"text":"でも……でも、ここを出てどこに行くつもりなのだ？","source_cn":"可是……可是离开呼临城以后，你们要去哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3D16B9700842DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521020018:0":{"text":"ここから一番近いのは<style=\"highlight\">トータス町</style>だけど、そこに行くのかい？","source_cn":"离这里最近的是<style=highlight>图塔镇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DE068F92C2FE227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521020019:0":{"text":"トータス町……？","source_cn":"图塔镇……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEAA8749A6B2E6DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521020020:0":{"text":"トータス町も天災に見舞われていると先生が言っていた……現にあそこは、かなり前からこの街との交易を断っているだろう。","source_cn":"我听老师说，图塔镇好像也发生了天灾……那里的居民都很久...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA028B9E921DCDD9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1521020021:0":{"text":"天災だと？あれほど敬虔に豊穣神様を信じているトータス町の人たちが、天災に遭うはずがないだろう！","source_cn":"什么天灾！图塔镇那么虔诚地信仰丰饶神，怎么可能会遇到天灾？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A00DB9FBAE07444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1521020022:1":{"text":"むしろ、ホーリン城の天災こそ<style=\"highlight\">豊穣神様が下された罰</style>ではないのか？有能な指導者ではなく、あんな、何もできない乳臭い子どもを領主に据えたことへの罰だよ！","source_cn":"要我说，呼临城遇到的天灾才是<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5D567238F9F5574","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1521020023:0":{"text":"な、何を言ってるんだ？余……領主のどこがダメなのだ！？","source_cn":"你……你在说什么？领主有什么问题？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB263CFFD8C1662D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1521020024:0":{"text":"坊主、今の領主は、お前さんと同じぐらいの年齢なんだ。子どもが、こんな大きな街をうまく治められると思うか？","source_cn":"孩子，领主的年纪应该和你差不多大，你觉得你能管理好这么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6BAEB9A9897D721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1521020025:0":{"text":"洪水が起きてから、領主は一度も我々の前に顔を出していない。それどころか、救援のために軍を戻すことすら渋っている！","source_cn":"洪水发生之后，领主有出面安抚过民众吗？他甚至都不舍得调...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x821B0105EAB12C09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1521020026:0":{"text":"なっ……そ、それは……","source_cn":"我……我……<key:dialog54>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD8A22398CEEA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_rec