ocument_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1521020030:0":{"text":"ヘルンニ殿下を知らないのか！？ホーリン城の先代領主にして初代領主であり、この国を築いたお方なのだぞ！","source_cn":"你们连赫伦尼殿下都不知道？！他是呼临城的前任领主，也是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A767A2191111E97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1521020031:1":{"text":"ヘルンニ殿下は聡明で強く、統率力があって、統治にも長けていたわ。貧民たちの暮らしにまで気を配ってくださっていたのよ。","source_cn":"赫伦尼殿下英明威武，既能领兵出征，也有统治才能，连最困...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA1D69B8A84FECCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1521020032:0":{"text":"でも、あまりにも早く亡くなられてしまって……残された跡継ぎが、今の幼い領主様なの。","source_cn":"只可惜他去世得太早，只留下年幼的继承人……就是现在的领主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC820C61D5A86545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1521020033:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……<key:dialog101>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD55FCAA62AA39B8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1521020034:1":{"text":"飢饉が起きた時も、救援所すら設置せず、配られる食料はごくわずかだった。俺やスイラみたいに足が遅い者は、そもそも手に入れることすらできなかったんだ。","source_cn":"城里闹饥荒的时候，城里几乎没有赈灾点，每天发放的食物也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF05F2512635F386E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_in